----------------

The bundled ski-area seed (src/data/seed/ski-areas.json) is a filtered extract
of OpenSkiData (https://openskimap.org), which is built from OpenStreetMap
(https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright) contributors and Skimap.org
(https://skimap.org). It is made available under the Open Database License
(ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

